{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y的“到时出现”感受在短时段里容易来不及扫到，X的静态右栏更方便随时补看和回顾。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮重点让观众迅速抓住人物每一阶段的核心念头，又把感受按音乐发生的顺序嵌入叙事，因此人物为什么动摇、为什么怀念、为什么最终选择继续向前，都更容易理解。它的情绪描写也更细腻，能从身体反应、音乐变化和心理活动多个层次呈现同一种感受，而不是简单贴上情绪标签。X唯一比较明显的优势是静态词组便于快速扫视和回看，但整体上Y更容易让普通观众在听音乐时感受到一段完整、具体且有内在因果的心路历程。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7b5bed2c-cb91-4094-831a-5bf6a3dfac17", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053700035925Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:37:54.045906+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b7855d6c72ffb99f630f4253130b67946142f86291cb56b1c6cf94dd9102f5c8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370